# Skill Editing Guidelines

When editing or creating skills:

## SKILL.md Structure

Every SKILL.md must have this frontmatter:

```yaml
---
name: skill-name
description: Clear description of when and how to use this skill
allowed-tools: "Read,Write,Edit,Bash,Glob,Grep,WebSearch,WebFetch"
---
```

## Checklist

- `name` field matches the parent directory name
- `description` is specific about triggers (when to use) and anti-triggers (when not to use)
- Body uses imperative tone
- Body does not repeat the description
- References are in `references/` subdirectory
- If creating a new skill, also create a matching `rules/<skill-name>.mdc` for Cursor
